","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1623477006:1":{"text":"可巴布你……你之前的文章不是一直站在同情那些魔力受损学生的立场上吗？","source_cn":"可巴布你……你之前的文章不是一直站在同情那些魔力受损学...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x919505F41E77AC77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1623477007:1":{"text":"那不过是这份工作的要求罢了。报酬的多少，直接决定了我的笔尖朝向哪边。","source_cn":"那不过是这份工作的要求罢了。报酬的多少，直接决定了我的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x223DFCC62C4B1B23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1623477008:1":{"text":"不怕告诉你们，之前那些丑化他们的爆款文章，也全都出自我手。","source_cn":"不怕告诉你们，之前那些丑化他们的爆款文章，也全都出自我手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x373B86D50E34CA33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1623477009:1":{"text":"只有刚入行的新手，才会天真地死抱着所谓的“真相”不放。真正的聪明人，只遵循酬劳指引的风向。","source_cn":"只有刚入行的新手，才会天真地死抱着所谓的“真相”不放。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A136ED7ACD51A73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1623477010:1":{"text":"这，才是新闻行业的真正规则。","source_cn":"这，才是新闻行业的真正规则。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EB7A2582F998BFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_f